{
  "name": "Ototext — Zamanlanmış Grup Broadcast",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ototext — Senaryo 1\n- `ID_INSTANCE` ve `API_TOKEN` `.env` üzerinden okunur.\n- Code düğümündeki chatId değerlerini gerçek grup ID'leriyle değiştirin.\n- Mesaj: `BROADCAST_MESSAGE` env veya Code içindeki `message`.\n- Schedule Trigger periyodunu ihtiyacınıza göre ayarlayın.\n\n**API:** `https://api.green-api.com/waInstance{{$env.ID_INSTANCE}}/sendMessage/{{$env.API_TOKEN}}`\n\n**Rate limit:** Her mesaj öncesi 3 dakika.\n**Not:** Wait düğümü için workflow Active olmalıdır.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-s1-notes",
      "name": "Kurulum Notları",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-trigger-s1",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 20 grup chatId + ortak mesaj metni\n// chatId değerlerini kendi Green API grup ID'lerinizle değiştirin\nconst message = $env.BROADCAST_MESSAGE || \"Merhaba! Bu, n8n üzerinden Green API ile gönderilen zamanlanmış bir grup mesajıdır.\";\n\nconst groupChatIds = [\n  \"120363000000000001@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000002@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000003@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000004@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000005@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000006@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000007@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000008@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000009@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000010@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000011@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000012@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000013@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000014@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000015@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000016@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000017@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000018@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000019@g.us\",\n  \"120363000000000020@g.us\"\n];\n\nreturn groupChatIds.map((chatId, index) => ({\n  json: {\n    index: index + 1,\n    chatId,\n    message\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "code-groups-s1",
      "name": "Grup Listesi Oluştur",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "loop-over-items-s1",
      "name": "Loop Over Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        520,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 3,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "wait-3min-s1",
      "name": "Wait 3 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        780,
        400
      ],
      "webhookId": "wait-3min-s1-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.green-api.com/waInstance{{ $env.ID_INSTANCE }}/sendMessage/{{ $env.API_TOKEN }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ chatId: $json.chatId, message: $json.message }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-send-message-s1",
      "name": "Green API - sendMessage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        400
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
